@startuml DS_04_Otorgar_Credito_y_Generar_Amortizacion
title DS_04: Diagrama de Secuencia - Otorgamiento de Credito y Generacion de Tabla de Amortizacion Francesa
autonumber
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing true

actor "Cliente / Vendedor" as User
boundary "Comercializadora App" as ClientApp
control "CreditoResource" as Resource
participant "CreditoService" as Service
database "BanQuito MariaDB" as DB

User -> ClientApp: Confirma compra: Celular $650.00 en 6 cuotas
activate ClientApp

ClientApp -> Resource: POST /api/credito/otorgar\n{ "codCliente": "CLI01", "precioTelefono": 650.00, "numeroCuotas": 6 }
activate Resource

Resource -> Service: otorgarCredito("CLI01", 650.00, 6)
activate Service

Service -> DB: Iniciar Transaccion ACID (Connection.setAutoCommit(false))
activate DB

Service -> DB: INSERT INTO CREDITO (COD_CLIENTE, MONTO, PLAZO, TASA, ESTADO) VALUES ('CLI01', 650.00, 6, 0.165, 'ACTIVO')
DB --> Service: codCredito Generado = 101

note over Service
  Calculo Cuota Francesa:
  TasaPeriodo = 0.165 / 12 = 0.01375
  CuotaFija = 650 / [ (1 - (1+0.01375)^-6) / 0.01375 ] = $113.58
end note

loop n = 1 hasta 6 cuotas
    Service -> DB: INSERT INTO AMORTIZACION (COD_CREDITO, NUM_CUOTA, VALOR_CUOTA, INTERES_PAGADO, CAPITAL_PAGADO, SALDO) VALUES (101, n, ...)
end

Service -> DB: COMMIT Transaccion
DB --> Service: Transaccion confirmada exitosamente
deactivate DB

Service --> Resource: CreditoOtorgadoDTO { codCredito: 101, monto: 650.00, cuotas: 6, cuotaFija: 113.58, amortizacion: [...] }
deactivate Service

Resource --> ClientApp: HTTP 201 Created\n{ "codCredito": 101, "monto": 650.00, "cuotaFija": 113.58, "tablaAmortizacion": [...] }
deactivate Resource

ClientApp --> User: Muestra confirmacion de credito otorgado y tabla completa de pagos
deactivate ClientApp

@enduml
